abstract: >-
  The original pipeline selected days by abnormal return and then looked for news, on a merged table containing 32 news rows and zero abnormal labels. Rebuilt with news as the event: 26 events, Patell Z -2.84 (p=0.0045), BMP t -3.24 (p=0.0034), 1/26 surviving Benjamini-Hochberg.
